{"page":316,"verses":[{"verse_key":"20:65","surah":20,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ إِمَّآ أَن تُلْقِىَ وَإِمَّآ أَن نَّكُونَ أَوَّلَ مَنْ أَلْقَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Moses, will you throw first or shall we?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِمَّآ","en_gloss":"Either","transliteration":"immā","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُلْقِىَ","en_gloss":"you throw","transliteration":"tul'qiya","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِمَّآ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"wa-immā","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّكُونَ","en_gloss":"we will be","transliteration":"nakūna","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوَّلَ","en_gloss":"the first","transliteration":"awwala","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلْقَىٰ","en_gloss":"throws","transliteration":"alqā","verse_key":"20:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:65"}]},{"verse_key":"20:66","surah":20,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ بَلْ أَلْقُوا۟ ۖ فَإِذَا حِبَالُهُمْ وَعِصِيُّهُمْ يُخَيَّلُ إِلَيْهِ مِن سِحْرِهِمْ أَنَّهَا تَسْعَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘You throw,’ said Moses, and––lo and behold!––through their sorcery, their ropes and staffs seemed to him to be moving.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"20:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"20:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَلْقُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"you throw","transliteration":"alqū","verse_key":"20:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then behold","translit