ىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Pharaoh said, ‘How dare you believe in him before I have given you permission? This must be your master, the man who taught you witchcraft. I shall certainly cut off your alternate hands and feet, then crucify you on the trunks of palm trees. You will know for certain which of us has the fiercer and more lasting punishment.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"You believe","transliteration":"āmantum","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"[to] him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qabla","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَاذَنَ","en_gloss":"I gave permission","transliteration":"ādhana","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَكَبِيرُكُمُ","en_gloss":"(is) your chief","transliteration":"lakabīrukumu","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَّمَكُمُ","en_gloss":"taught you","transliteration":"ʿallamakumu","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلسِّحْرَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the magic","transliteration":"l-siḥ'ra","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَلَأُقَطِّعَنَّ","en_gloss":"So surely I will cut off","transliteration":"fala-uqaṭṭiʿanna","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَيْدِيَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your hands","transliteration":"aydiyakum","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَرْجُلَكُم","en_gloss":"and your feet","transliteration":"wa-arjulakum","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"20:71"},{"pos":17,"ar":"خِلَـٰفٍۢ","en_g